        prompt: "The scene of the exit between the dam and the building before dawn in the old residential area of Sichuan and Chongqing. {{Mixed 1}}In, filming the first episode of \"Unknown Cat\" 06:55-07:10.\n\n{{Mixed 5}}For the final tail frame of the video from 06:35 to 06:55, anchor the exact posture of the chicken's forehead against the tip of the preserved egg's nose.\n\n{{Mixed 1}}为同一坝子的黎明版本，建筑、白色床单、低花台、浅泥水、通信电线和右后方楼间出口空间保持固定。\n\n{{Mixed 2}}For blue-gray semi-large cat preserved eggs. {{Mixed 3}}Chicken for young sparrows.\n\nThere are only preserved eggs and chicken in the picture. No other cats, no humans, no subtitles.\n\nThe sky transitioned from deep cold blue to cold gray blue before dawn. The first layer of soft morning light appeared at the exit between the buildings, with no sun, golden beams or orange-red sunrise.\n\nThe whole is a movie-level national semi-realistic 3D animation style, real PBR wet cat hair, sparrow feathers, mud, cement and fabric materials, 2.39:1 movie wide frame. The injury of the preserved egg was always retained, and the walking was obviously lame. The right wing of the Yao chicken was always injured.\n\nThere was no music in the first half. After the \"brothers\" are dropped, add extremely light warm wooden pipes and whisper the strings. The end is dominated by the early morning wind.\n\n06:55-06:59 | Redefine each other\n\nCut 75mm front-to-ground double-character close-up shot.\n\nThe camera is located directly in front of the preserved egg and the chicken, pushing very slowly along the muddy surface. The chicken's forehead is still stuck to the tip of the preserved egg's nose, and the preserved egg looks at it with tears in its eyes.\n\nYao chicken did not move away, voice clear and firm:\n\nThe Chicken]\n\"You still have my brothers. 」\n\nA short pause.\n\nYao chicken raised his wet head and seriously added:\n\nThe Chicken]\n\"We want to be bigger and stronger. 」\n\nCut 85mm preserved egg positive reaction close-up.\n\nThe preserved egg wait for a while looked at the Yao chicken. It contains a bag of tears, bloody corners of the mouth difficult to pull open, revealing an ugly but true smile:\n\npreserved egg]\n\"... Brothers. 」\n\nWarm wooden tube in this sentence fell gently.\n\n06:59-07:03 | Yao chicken into scarf\n\nCut 50mm close to the ground side midfield.\n\nThe first layer of cold gray-blue morning light appeared in the sky. The Yao chicken jumped to the curved front leg of the preserved egg first, and then slowly climbed to the neck side of the preserved egg along the soaked dark red scarf with the help of the beak and claws.\n\nThe Yao chicken does not use the injured right wing to continue flying, only the left wing is briefly opened to maintain balance. It burrowed into the gap between the scarf and the neck of the preserved egg, revealing its head:\n\nThe Chicken]\n\"Go. Go pick up a clean carton box to make the bed. 」\n\n06:03-07:07 | The preserved egg stands up again\n\nCut the 35mm low side midfield.\n\nThe camera is close to the concrete floor, leaving the preserved egg limbs, muddy water edges and rear floor exits intact.\n\nPearls the two front paws against the ground, clenched his teeth and propped up his shoulders. The first load on the left front leg was clearly weak and the body sank once.\n\nIt stops breathing, readjusts its front paws, and retracts its two hind legs a little below its abdomen. The hindquarters rocked and lifted, and the four legs continued to tremble.\n\nThe preserved egg finally stands firm. It is still arched back, left foreleg dare not fully force, dark red scarf attached to the chest dripping water.\n\npreserved egg]\n\"... go. 」\n\nThe camera slowly rises to cat's back height as the preserved egg stands up.\n\n07:07-07:10 | Towards the first morning light\n\nCut 32mm back mid-range view.\n\nStarting from the muddy edge of the dam, the preserved egg limped towards the exit between the right rear floors. With each step, the left front leg briefly leaves the ground and the body's center of gravity shifts significantly to the right.\n\nThe Yao chicken nests quietly in the scarf, its head undulates slightly with the pace of the preserved egg.\n\nThe camera slowly retreated from behind both and began to rise. White sheets, electric wires and gray-blue old buildings gradually unfold, and the cold gray morning light of the alley lies in front of the picture.\n\n[Peaked Egg-Voiceover]]\n\"It turns out that the wind of freedom... is really freezing. 」\n\nThe sound of the wind increased gently, skimming the white sheets and communication wires.\n\nThe last frame:\n\nThe back of the preserved egg and the old chicken walked into the cold gray morning light on the first floor of the exit between the buildings. The camera rises above the white sheet and the sky in the distance is soft fish-belly white. The screen then enters the black field.\n\nThe title \"Unknown Cat\" was added later, and text was not directly generated in the generated screen.\n\nNo sudden healing, no fast running, no golden sunrise, no new animals, no role duplication, no directional jump.",
